    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d78">

                <pb facs="0204" n="112" xml:id="pg112"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Zalles to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">La
                                Paz, Bolivia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-07-06"><hi rendition="#italic">July 6,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 127.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In the case of Capt. John S. Bowles, I have
                    the honor to report that since the 25th of April he was released by order of Dr.
                    Rafael Pinto, the leader of the revolution in Santa Cruz.</p>
                <p>* * * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gerardo Zalles.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
